OL,3,AFour works of art, worth millions,
OL,4,Astolen from Renoir museum in France
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo thieves have stolen four works of
OL,7,Fart from a Renoir museum in France -
OL,8,Fabandoning one as they fled, the local
OL,9,Fmayor says
OL,11,FThe mayor's office says the estimated
OL,12,Fvalue of the stolen art is 9m euros
OL,13,F(#7.7m; $10.5m), French media reports
OL,15,FOne French outlet says the four stolen
OL,16,Fpaintings are: Portrait of Madame
OL,17,FPichon (1895); Portrait of Madame
OL,18,FColonna Romano (1910); Coco Lisant
OL,19,F(1905); and Jeune fille au puits (1886)
OL,20,F- it's not known which was abandoned
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
